<title>USA: Reliance Industries issues 144A notes.</title>
<headline>Reliance Industries issues 144A notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144A debt issue from Reliance Industries was priced in the private placement market on Thursday, according to lead manager Morgan Stanley &amp; Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER RELIANCE INDUSTRIES LTD</p>
<p>AMT $214 MLN	 COUPON 8.25 PCT   MATURITY 01/15/2027</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA3  YIELD 8.25 PCT    PAY FREQ	 N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB-PLUS   SPREAD 175 BP     PUTABLE IN THE 10TH YEAR</p>
<p>BORROWER RELIANCE INDUSTRIES LTD</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 10.25 PCT  MATURITY 01/15/2097</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.129  FIRST PAY DATE N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA3  YIELD 10.34 PCT   PAY FREQ	 N.A.</p>
